  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "Adding and taking away are linked. One set of numbers gives a **fact family**.\n\n7, 3 and 10 give four facts: 7 + 3 = 10, 3 + 7 = 10, 10 - 3 = 7 and 10 - 7 = 3."
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "emoji": "🔺",
   "alt": "A fact family triangle: 10 at the top, and 7 and 3 at the bottom corners.",
   "caption": "A fact family triangle: 10 at the top, and 7 and 3 at the bottom corners."
  },
  {
   "type": "check",
   "question": {
